# The inline renderer glues runs of text, emphasis and links together inside a sentence, so a
# newline between `<em>` and its child is a text node the reader sees: the formatter's version of
# this file renders "in Glossary ." with a space before the full stop. prettier-plugin-astro does
# not honour `<!-- prettier-ignore -->` or `{/* prettier-ignore */}`, so the file is excluded here
# and kept formatted by hand. `tests/e2e/content.spec.ts` compares the rendered text of every
# paragraph with the text in `src/data`, so a reformat fails the suite rather than shipping.
